  "official_source_notes": [
    "The Jefferson County PVA site supports public Address and Parcel ID searches with limited property information.",
    "The PVA subscription service documents detailed fields such as mailing address, land value, improvements value, assessment history, property class, tax information, year built, square footage, and building type.",
    "The PVA records request menu documents standardized database requests, including Ownership Record, Assessment Roll, Assessment Roll Plus, and Digital Parcel with Owner Info.",
    "Jefferson County Clerk land records, Kentucky SOS business records, LOJIC zoning/planning layers, Louisville active construction permits, property maintenance occupancy records, and MSD floodplain information are source-linked but require their own join logic before parcel-level values are claimed.",
    "Louisville active construction permits are official open data with permit number, type/status, contractor, occupancy category, work type, zoning, square footage, fee/cost, address, coordinates, and issue date fields; the parcel join remains pending.",
    "Property maintenance occupancy records are inspection context only and must not be labeled as formal Certificate of Occupancy records.",
    "Do not infer owner phone/email from the LOJIC parcel layer. Only map phone/email if an official PVA or approved source export explicitly includes those fields."
  ],
